OL,3,GNEWSAArchives and former World War One
OL,4,Adrill hall destroyed in blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former World War One drill hall which
OL,7,Fhoused historic archives, including old
OL,8,Fphotographs, has been destroyed in a
OL,9,Ffire.
OL,11,FThe building in Coigach, north of
OL,12,FUllapool, had later served as a village
OL,13,Fhall before it was recently turned into
OL,14,Fa heritage centre.
OL,16,FThe property was gutted by an early
OL,17,Fmorning blaze on Monday.
OL,19,FIain Muir, chairman of Coigach
OL,20,FHeritage, said a "considerable amount"
OL,21,Fof archives had been lost.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
